 server-side tools for building and managing LTSP (Linux Terminal
 Server Project) thin-client chroot images, plus the NBD root/swap
 servers used to serve them over the network.
 .
 ltsp-support opens a support session on a client: it lists the
 clients that have booted, asks the user there for consent, and shows
